abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 + Mathlib formalization of Lévy-driven stochastic calculus: L²
  Itô integrals against Brownian motion and compensated Poisson random
  measures, the Itô-Lévy formula for C^{1,2} functions of jump diffusions,
  and backward stochastic differential equations with jumps (BSDEJs).
